---
import type { Locale } from '../../i18n';
import { localePath } from '../../i18n';
import ExternalBrandMark from '../common/ExternalBrandMark';
import MathFormula from '../common/MathFormula.astro';
import { GATED_DELTA_SD_LORA_PUBLICATION as snapshot } from '../../data/gatedDeltaSdLoraPublicationSnapshot';

interface Props { locale: Locale }
const { locale } = Astro.props;
const zh = locale === 'zh';
const t = (cn: string, en: string) => zh ? cn : en;
const p = (path: string) => localePath(locale, path);
const historyHref = p('/research/seed-openevo/study/capability-exploration/gdr-directapply/');
const vanillaHref = p('/research/seed-openevo/flow/sd-lora/');
const successorHref = p('/research/seed-openevo/study/capability-exploration/bounded-effective-state-gdr/');
const flaHref = 'https://github.com/fla-org/flash-linear-attention/blob/516143e31fce09925e6c39ac37148444bad176c4/fla/ops/gated_delta_rule/naive.py';
const paperHref = 'https://arxiv.org/abs/2412.06464';
const evidenceFor = (id: string) => id === 'beta-g'
  ? [snapshot.evidence.treatmentDecision, snapshot.evidence.d1Preregistration, snapshot.evidence.d26Qualification]
  : id === 'optimizer-factor'
    ? [snapshot.evidence.eventWriteDesign, snapshot.evidence.treatmentDecision]
    : [snapshot.evidence.eventWriteDesign];

const math = {
  stateShape: String.raw`S_t\in\mathbb{R}^{d_v\times d_k}`,
  linearWrite: String.raw`S_t = S_{t-1} + v_t k_t^{\top}`,
  objective: String.raw`\mathcal{L}_t(S)=\frac{1}{2}\left\lVert S k_t-v_t\right\rVert_2^2`,
  gradient: String.raw`\nabla_S\mathcal{L}_t=(S k_t-v_t)k_t^{\top}`,
  delta: String.raw`S_t=S_{t-1}-\beta_t\nabla_S\mathcal{L}_t
= S_{t-1}+\beta_t\left(v_t-S_{t-1}k_t\right)k_t^{\top}`,
  gated: String.raw`S_t=\alpha_t S_{t-1}\left(I-\beta_t k_t k_t^{\top}\right)+\beta_t v_t k_t^{\top}`,
  residual: String.raw`\begin{aligned}
\widetilde S_{t-1}&=\alpha_t S_{t-1}\\
r_t&=v_t-\widetilde S_{t-1}k_t\\
S_t&=\widetilde S_{t-1}+\beta_t r_t k_t^{\top}
\end{aligned}`,
  taskVector: String.raw`\Delta\theta_t=\theta_t-\theta_{t-1}`,
  gauge: String.raw`\Delta W = C A^{\top},\qquad A\mapsto sA,\quad C\mapsto C/s
\quad\Longrightarrow\quad \Delta W\text{ unchanged}`,
  parameterMap: String.raw`S_t^{(\alpha=1,\,\beta\text{-gate})}=\operatorname{Compress}_{128}\!\left(S_{t-1}+\operatorname{Gate}_{\beta_t}(\Delta_t)\right)`,
  factors: String.raw`S_A=A,\qquad S_C=C^{\top},\qquad g=0\;(\alpha=1)`,
  stateSymbol: String.raw`S_t`,
  residualWriteSymbol: String.raw`r_t k_t^{\top}`,
  betaSymbol: String.raw`\beta_t`,
  retentionSymbol: String.raw`\alpha_t\;/\;g_t`,
  gZero: String.raw`g=0`,
  alphaOne: String.raw`\alpha=1`,
  kvSymbol: String.raw`k_t\;/\;v_t`,
  qualificationGate: String.raw`\beta\in[${snapshot.routeSExecution.betaMinObserved.toExponential(2)},\;${snapshot.routeSExecution.betaMaxObserved.toFixed(6)}],\qquad g=0`,
};
---

<article class="gds-page" data-testid="gated-delta-sd-lora-page" data-copy-review data-reader-page="research-explainer">
  <header class="gds-hero" data-reader-context id="top">
    <a class="gds-back" href={p('/research/seed-openevo/study/capability-exploration/')}>← {t('OpenEvo 能力探索', 'OpenEvo capability exploration')}</a>
    <h1>{t('Gated Delta：从序列 State 到参数 State', 'Gated Delta: from sequence State to parameter State')}</h1>
    <p class="gds-hero__lede" data-reader-task data-reader-purpose>{t(
      'Gated Delta 最初是序列建模里的一个持续 State 更新规则。这页从它的 online regression 目标开始，把梯度一步一步推成 residual write，再说明我们怎样把“长期 State、残差写入、动态写入强度”这些角色对应到 OpenEVO 的 LoRA 参数更新。',
      'Gated Delta starts as a recurrent State update rule for sequence modeling. This page begins from its online-regression objective, derives the residual write step by step, then shows how the roles of persistent State, residual write, and adaptive write strength map onto OpenEVO LoRA updates.'
    )}</p>
    <p class="gds-hero__boundary">{t(
      '论文公式到 residual 形式是严格代数等价；从 sequence State 到 OpenEVO parameter State 是逐角色映射，不把 k / v 张量逐字当成 LoRA 张量。',
      'The paper equation and residual form are algebraically identical. Moving from sequence State to OpenEVO parameter State is a role-level mapping rather than a literal k/v-to-LoRA tensor identity.'
    )}</p>
    <p class="gds-hero__history"><a href={historyHref}>{t('旧 GDR-v1 / DirectApply 到底做了什么 →', 'What did the old GDR-v1 / DirectApply experiment actually do? →')}</a></p>
  </header>

  <section class="gds-section" id="recurrence" aria-labelledby="recurrence-title">
    <h2 id="recurrence-title">{t('从 sequence State 推到 residual write', 'From sequence State to a residual write')}</h2>
    <p>{t(
      '先只看论文里的序列状态。Gated Delta Networks 把 State 写成一个 value 维 × key 维的矩阵：给一个 key，State 的矩阵乘法会读出当前已经记住的 value。最简单的线性注意力会把新的 value-key 外积直接累加进 State。',
      'Start with the sequence-model state used in the paper. Gated Delta Networks writes State as a value-dimension by key-dimension matrix: multiplying it by a key reads the value currently stored for that key. Plain linear attention simply accumulates a new value-key outer product into State.'
    )}</p>
    <MathFormula latex={math.stateShape} label={t('论文采用的 State 形状', 'State shape used by the paper')} compact />
    <MathFormula latex={math.linearWrite} label={t('线性注意力的外积写入', 'Outer-product write in linear attention')} />

    <h3>{t('Delta Rule 可以从 online regression 直接推出来', 'The Delta Rule follows directly from online regression')}</h3>
    <p>{t(
      '把 State 看成一个“用 key 预测 value”的快速权重矩阵。当前样本希望 State 对这个 key 的读出接近目标 value，因此可以写出一个最普通的平方误差。',
      'Treat State as a fast-weight matrix that predicts a value from a key. The current sample wants the State readout for that key to match the target value, so the objective is an ordinary squared error.'
    )}</p>
    <MathFormula latex={math.objective} label={t('当前 key-value 对的在线回归目标', 'Online-regression objective for the current key-value pair')} />
    <p>{t(
      '对 S 求梯度，得到“当前读出的内容 − 目标 value”乘上 key 的外积。',
      'Differentiating with respect to S gives the outer product of the prediction error and the key.'
    )}</p>
    <MathFormula latex={math.gradient} label={t('online regression 对 State 的梯度', 'Gradient of the online-regression objective with respect to State')} compact />
    <p>{t(
      '做一步梯度下降以后，减去 prediction error 就等价于把“目标 value − 旧 State 对 key 的读出”这个 residual 写回。这里没有类比：这是同一个目标函数的一步 SGD 展开。',
      'One gradient-descent step subtracts the prediction error, which is exactly the same as writing back the residual “target value minus the prior-State readout for the key.” This is algebra, not an analogy: it is one SGD step on the same objective.'
    )}</p>
    <MathFormula latex={math.delta} label={t('Delta Rule 的 SGD 与 residual 两种等价写法', 'Equivalent SGD and residual forms of the Delta Rule')} />

    <h3>{t('Gated Delta 再加一件事：旧 State 可以先衰减', 'Gated Delta adds one more operation: decay the prior State first')}</h3>
    <p>{t(
      'Gated Delta 在 Delta Rule 前面加入 retention α_t。论文写法如下；α_t 决定旧 State 留多少，β_t 决定这次 residual 写多强。',
      'Gated Delta adds a retention factor alpha_t before the Delta Rule. In the paper form below, alpha_t controls how much prior State remains, while beta_t controls the strength of the residual write.'
    )}</p>
    <MathFormula latex={math.gated} label={t('Gated Delta Networks 的状态更新公式', 'State update in Gated Delta Networks')} />
    <p>{t(
      '先把“保留后的旧 State”单独记下来，再把括号展开，就得到下面的 residual 形式。按照论文的矩阵形状，residual 必须在外积左侧、key 在右侧；准确方向由下方 LaTeX 公式给出。',
      'Name the retained prior State first, then expand the brackets to obtain the residual form below. Under the paper’s matrix shape, the residual must be on the left side of the outer product and the key on the right; the exact orientation is shown in the LaTeX equation below.'
    )}</p>
    <MathFormula latex={math.residual} label={t('Gated Delta 的严格等价 residual 形式', 'Algebraically equivalent residual form of Gated Delta')} />
    <p class="gds-callout">{t(
      '严格等价到这里为止：论文公式、SGD 形式和 residual 形式都描述同一个 sequence State 更新。下一步进入 OpenEVO 时，我们保留这些数学角色，但不会声称 k / v 与某两个 LoRA 张量存在逐元素 1:1 等式。',
      'Exact equivalence ends here: the paper equation, SGD form, and residual form describe the same sequence-State update. When we move into OpenEVO, we preserve these mathematical roles without claiming an elementwise identity between k/v and two LoRA tensors.'
    )}</p>

    <h3>{t('映射到 OpenEVO：对应的是角色，不是张量名字', 'Mapping into OpenEVO: match the roles, not the tensor names')}</h3>
    <div class="gds-map-wrap">
      <table class="gds-map">
        <thead><tr><th>{t('序列 Gated Delta', 'Sequence Gated Delta')}</th><th>{t('数学角色', 'Role')}</th><th>{t('OpenEVO 里的对应物', 'OpenEVO counterpart')}</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td><MathFormula latex={math.stateSymbol} display={false} /></td><td>{t('跨时间持续保存的 State', 'State persisted across time')}</td><td>{t('固定 rank128 的长期参数 State', 'fixed-rank128 long-term parameter State')}</td></tr>
          <tr><td><MathFormula latex={math.residualWriteSymbol} display={false} /></td><td>{t('旧 State 没解释掉的新信息', 'new information not explained by prior State')}</td><td>{t('当前训练真正留下的有效 LoRA 参数写入 ΔW', 'the effective LoRA parameter write ΔW left by current training')}</td></tr>
          <tr><td><MathFormula latex={math.betaSymbol} display={false} /></td><td>{t('这一步写多强', 'write strength for this step')}</td><td>{t('冻结 controller 根据局部参数 / 梯度 / Adam 状态动态给出 β', 'a frozen controller chooses β from local parameter, gradient, and Adam state')}</td></tr>
          <tr><td><MathFormula latex={math.retentionSymbol} display={false} /></td><td>{t('旧 State 保留多少', 'retention of prior State')}</td><td>{t('第一版正式实验固定', 'the first formal study fixes')} <MathFormula latex={math.gZero} display={false} />{t('，因此', ', hence')} <MathFormula latex={math.alphaOne} display={false} /></td></tr>
          <tr><td><MathFormula latex={math.kvSymbol} display={false} /></td><td>{t('读取旧 State / 指定当前目标', 'read prior State / specify the current target')}</td><td>{t('只保留这层读写语义；不逐字映射成 LoRA 的 A / C', 'the read/write semantics are preserved; k/v are not literally renamed as LoRA A/C')}</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
    <MathFormula latex={math.parameterMap} label={t('映射到参数 State 后的概念式', 'Conceptual update after mapping into parameter State')} />
    <p>{t(
      '这个概念式还多了一个 OpenEVO 自己的机制：Compress_128 把历史重新压回固定 rank128。它来自我们的 Bounded Online Recurrence，不是 Gated DeltaNet 论文里的操作。实际 runtime 还会先更新 C 得到真实 C1，再基于 C1 更新 A。',
      'This conceptual equation contains an OpenEVO-specific mechanism as well: Compress_128 folds history back to fixed rank128. That operation comes from Bounded Online Recurrence rather than the Gated DeltaNet paper. The actual runtime also writes C first to obtain the realized C1, then writes A conditioned on C1.'
    )}</p>
    <p class="gds-sources"><a href={flaHref} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"><ExternalBrandMark href={flaHref} />Flash Linear Attention reference</a> · <a href={paperHref} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"><ExternalBrandMark href={paperHref} />Gated Delta Networks · ICLR 2025</a></p>
    <p class="gds-related"><a href={successorHref}>{t('回到三组 1.7B 已完成实验：这个映射最后怎样进入 β-gating（α=1）→', 'Back to the three completed 1.7B experiments: how this mapping becomes β-gating (α=1) →')}</a></p>
  </section>

  <section class="gds-section" id="task-vector" aria-labelledby="task-vector-title">
    <h2 id="task-vector-title">{t('Task Vector 的角色', 'The role of the Task Vector')}</h2>
    <p>{t('Task Vector 记录一次训练前后参数移动了多少、朝哪里移动，因此适合做事后几何分析、离线 teacher / label 和训练后的比较。但它不参与当前在线写入：运行时的 K / V / β / g 不能由 Task Vector、WebShop 分数或固定 16 题候选检查来控制。', 'A Task Vector records how far and in what direction the parameters moved across an update, so it remains useful for retrospective geometry, offline teacher / label work, and post-hoc comparison. It does not control the current online write: runtime K / V / β / g cannot be driven by the Task Vector, WebShop score, or a candidate probe.')}</p>
    <div class="gds-tv-boundary">
      <dl>
        <div><dt>{t('可以用来', 'Allowed')}</dt><dd>{t('事后参数几何 · 离线 teacher / label · 训练后评估', 'retrospective geometry · offline teacher / label · post-hoc evaluation')}</dd></div>
        <div><dt>{t('不能进入', 'Forbidden at runtime')}</dt><dd>{t('K / V · β · g · WebShop 分数 / reward · 固定 16 题候选检查', 'K / V · β · g · WebShop score / reward · fixed 16-task candidate check')}</dd></div>
      </dl>
      <MathFormula latex={math.taskVector} display={false} label={t('Task Vector 定义', 'Task Vector definition')} />
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="gds-section" id="derivation" aria-labelledby="derivation-title">
    <h2 id="derivation-title">{t('我们怎样排除错误的参数映射', 'How we ruled out incorrect parameter mappings')}</h2>
    <p>{t('上面的数学只规定“State 怎样读、residual 怎样写”。真正落到 LoRA 时，还要找到什么信号能代表当前写入、AdamW 历史怎样进入，以及 State 放在哪里。下面四步保留我们当时排除错误方案的证据。', 'The mathematics above specifies how State is read and how a residual is written. Mapping that rule into LoRA still requires identifying the signal that represents the current write, incorporating AdamW history, and choosing where State lives. The four steps below preserve the evidence that ruled out incorrect mappings.')}</p>
    <ol class="gds-derivation">
      {snapshot.derivation.map((step, index) => (
        <li>
          <div class="gds-derivation__index" aria-hidden="true">{String(index + 1).padStart(2, '0')}</div>
          <div class="gds-derivation__body">
            <small>{t(step.readerLabelZh, step.readerLabelEn)}</small>
            <h3>{t(step.titleZh, step.titleEn)}</h3>
            <p>{t(step.bodyZh, step.bodyEn)}</p>
            <details>
              <summary>{t('查看这一步的研究证据', 'Open evidence for this step')}</summary>
              <p class="gds-evidence-status"><code>{step.verdict}</code></p>
              <div class="gds-evidence-links">
                {evidenceFor(step.id).map((href) => <a href={href} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"><ExternalBrandMark href={href} />{href.includes('json') ? t('机器证据（需仓库权限）', 'machine evidence (repository access required)') : t('研究文档（需仓库权限）', 'research note (repository access required)')}</a>)}
              </div>
            </details>
          </div>
        </li>
      ))}
    </ol>
  </section>

  <section class="gds-section" id="factor-state" aria-labelledby="factor-state-title">
    <h2 id="factor-state-title">{t('早期资格实验：State 怎样落到 LoRA A / C', 'Earlier qualification: placing State in LoRA A/C')}</h2>
    <p>{t(
      '这里记录的是前一版 event-write 资格实验，不是后面三组 160 轮实验的 rank128 Bounded State。它解决的是另一个具体问题：如果直接在 LoRA 的低秩因子上写，怎样避免因子坐标本身影响 β。',
      'This section records the earlier event-write qualification, not the rank-128 Bounded State used in the later three 160-round experiments. It addresses a different question: how to avoid making beta depend on arbitrary LoRA-factor coordinates when writing directly into low-rank factors.'
    )}</p>
    <p>{t(
      '同一个有效更新 ΔW 可以由很多组 A / C 表示。A 乘一个常数、C 除以同一个常数，真正加到模型上的矩阵不变，所以 raw factor 的大小不能直接当作“学习了多少”。',
      'The same effective update ΔW can be represented by many A/C pairs. Scaling A up and C down by the same factor leaves the matrix applied to the model unchanged, so raw factor magnitude cannot directly mean “how much was learned.”'
    )}</p>
    <MathFormula latex={math.gauge} label={t('LoRA 因子缩放不改变有效参数更新', 'LoRA factor rescaling leaves the effective parameter update unchanged')} />
    <p>{t(
      '因此资格实验先在不受这种缩放选择影响的有效写入上决定强度，再把写入落回 A / C。那一版把两个持续状态放在 A 与 C 的转置上，并固定 g = 0。',
      'The qualification therefore chose write strength on the gauge-invariant effective write before applying it back to A/C. That version stored the two persistent states in A and the transpose of C, while fixing g=0.'
    )}</p>
    <MathFormula latex={math.factors} label={t('早期 event-write 资格实验里的 LoRA State 放置', 'LoRA State placement in the earlier event-write qualification')} />
    <figure class="gds-runtime" data-testid="gated-delta-runtime-path">
      <div class="gds-runtime__flow">
        <div class="gds-node is-event"><small>{t('当前学习事件', 'learning event')}</small><strong>{t('activation + supervised error', 'activation + supervised error')}</strong></div>
        <div class="gds-connector" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="gds-node is-signal"><small>{t('真实写入信号', 'realized write signal')}</small><strong>{t('梯度 + AdamW 历史', 'gradient + AdamW history')}</strong></div>
        <div class="gds-connector" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="gds-node is-gate"><small>{t('动态写入强度', 'adaptive write strength')}</small><strong>{t('冻结 β controller；g 固定为 0', 'frozen beta controller; g fixed at 0')}</strong></div>
        <div class="gds-connector" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="gds-node is-next"><small>{t('写回 LoRA', 'write back into LoRA')}</small><strong>{t('先得到真实 C1，再据此更新 A', 'obtain realized C1 first, then update A conditioned on it')}</strong></div>
      </div>
      <figcaption>{t(`第一版四轮对照只在 ${snapshot.treatmentScope.gatedModules} 使用 Gated Delta；其它 LoRA 模块仍按 Vanilla DirectApply 更新。它的作用是验证 event-write 映射能真实运行，不代表后续 rank128 Bounded + β-gating（α=1）的全部实现；动态 α + 动态 β 尚未运行。`, `The first four-round comparison applies Gated Delta only to ${snapshot.treatmentScope.gatedModules}; the other LoRA modules keep Vanilla DirectApply. Its role is to verify that event-write mapping works in a real run, not to define the full later rank-128 Bounded + β-gating (α=1) implementation; dynamic α + dynamic β has not been run.`)}</figcaption>
    </figure>
    <p class="gds-related"><a href={vanillaHref}>{t('对照阅读：Vanilla SD-LoRA 一轮怎样更新 →', 'Compare with one Vanilla SD-LoRA update →')}</a></p>
  </section>

  <section class="gds-section gds-d1" id="d1-boundary" aria-labelledby="d1-boundary-title">
    <h2 id="d1-boundary-title">{t('四轮配对资格实验已完成并封存', 'The four-round paired qualification is complete and sealed')}</h2>
    <p>{t('Round 0 两组完全相同；从 Round 1 开始，两种参数更新已经产生不同状态。四轮全部完成后，treatment-control 的 reward 差分别是 0、+0.0247、+0.0970、+0.0209；完整成功差是 0、+6、+58、+11。预注册的四轮资格实验因此支持一个有限结论：在这份冻结 schedule 上，GDR 高于匹配的 Vanilla 对照。', 'Round 0 is identical across arms; from Round 1 onward the two update rules have produced different model states. Across the four sealed rounds, treatment-minus-control reward deltas are 0, +0.0247, +0.0970, and +0.0209, while exact-success deltas are 0, +6, +58, and +11. The preregistered qualification therefore supports one bounded conclusion: on this frozen schedule, GDR outperformed the matched Vanilla control.')}</p>
    <dl class="gds-d1__facts">
      <div><dt>{t('真实 WebShop 运行', 'Real WebShop run')}</dt><dd>{t(`${snapshot.routeSExecution.attemptCount} rollouts · ${snapshot.routeSExecution.semanticTaskIdentityCount} 个任务 · ${snapshot.routeSExecution.cleanExactSuccessCount} 条 clean exact success（覆盖 ${snapshot.routeSExecution.cleanExactSuccessTaskCount} 个任务）`, `${snapshot.routeSExecution.attemptCount} rollouts · ${snapshot.routeSExecution.semanticTaskIdentityCount} tasks · ${snapshot.routeSExecution.cleanExactSuccessCount} clean exact successes across ${snapshot.routeSExecution.cleanExactSuccessTaskCount} tasks`)}</dd></div>
      <div><dt>{t('真实参数写入', 'Real parameter write')}</dt><dd>{snapshot.routeSExecution.optimizerSteps} optimizer steps · {snapshot.routeSExecution.appliedFactorWrites.toLocaleString('en-US')} factor writes · {snapshot.routeSExecution.zeroDirectionNoops} zero-direction no-ops</dd></div>
      <div><dt>{t('写入 / 保留 gate', 'Write / retention gate')}</dt><dd><MathFormula latex={math.qualificationGate} display={false} /> · {t('g=0，因此旧 State 不额外衰减（retention=1）', 'g=0, so the old State gets no extra decay (retention=1)')}</dd></div>
      <div><dt>{t('在线更新不能看', 'Runtime cannot read')}</dt><dd>{t('Task Vector · WebShop 分数 / reward · 固定 16 题检查结果 · final panel 信息（当前运行均为 0 次读取）', 'Task Vector · WebShop score / reward · fixed 16-task check results · final-panel information (all read counts were zero in this run)')}</dd></div>
      <div><dt>{t('配对实验进度', 'Paired-study progress')}</dt><dd>{zh ? `${snapshot.pairedD1.roundsSealed} / ${snapshot.pairedD1.roundCount} 轮已封存 · 每组 ${snapshot.pairedD1.roundsSealed * snapshot.pairedD1.rolloutsPerRoundPerArm} / ${snapshot.pairedD1.rolloutsPerArm} 次任务尝试 · ${snapshot.pairedD1.fullProgressPercent}% 按冻结清单完成` : `${snapshot.pairedD1.roundsSealed} / ${snapshot.pairedD1.roundCount} rounds sealed · ${snapshot.pairedD1.roundsSealed * snapshot.pairedD1.rolloutsPerRoundPerArm} / ${snapshot.pairedD1.rolloutsPerArm} rollouts per arm · ${snapshot.pairedD1.fullProgressPercent}% by the frozen checklist`}</dd></div>
